# Answers to the specific questions above (0.36-se.4).
@kind reply
@answers ask_findgroup
@who *
say lfg in faction with your level and class, someone usually bites
ask at a busy camp, groups often need one more
lfg in faction, and check the dungeon entrance for your level
just ask around, most groups at your level want more people
@kind reply
@answers ask_power
@who *
yes, at low levels everyone goes oom fast
sit between fights, power comes back a lot faster sitting
use your lower spells on easy pulls, they cost less
it gets better as you level, sit and med between pulls
@kind reply
@answers ask_con
@who *
grey means too low, no xp at all
grey is no xp, green is a little, blue and yellow are the good stuff
blue is a bit under you, yellow is even, orange is a fight
grey, green, blue, yellow, orange, red, purple. easy to hard
anything red or purple will kill you, grey is a waste of time
@kind reply
@answers ask_pulling
@who *
pull with a bow or a spell so it comes to you alone
back way off first, some monsters bring their friends
pull from the edge of the camp, never the middle
if two come anyway, mez or root one and kill the other
watch which ones stand close together, those come as a pack
@kind reply
@answers ask_merchant
@who *
any merchant buys it, they all pay the same
every merchant takes everything, just sell it to the closest one
try the exchange first, merchants pay less
the nearest merchant will take it, price is the same everywhere

